T-Hist 1.4.0 History Utility - Mailer load statistics.
Executables for Linux and Windows.  Creates FTN-system
load statistics based on data in mailer's binary logs. 
Supported mailers: T-Mail, Binkd, Argus, Internet Rex, 
FrontDoor, Bink/+, FhMail, BinkleyTerm-XE, The Brake!,
KittenMail, DVMmail, XMail32, BasicMail.     Copyright
